# =============================================================================
# Hermes Agent — Security Policy: API Keys Excluded Per Security Policy
# =============================================================================
# API keys and sensitive values are NEVER committed to this repository.
# Hermes reads from $HERMES_HOME/.env at runtime — keys are provided by injection
# from the host environment, not stored in source control.
#
# See SECURITY.md for full policy details.
# =============================================================================
#
# Exclude all environment and credential files — these contain sensitive values
# that must not be version-controlled. Hermes resolves these at runtime.
.env
*.env
*.key
secrets/
credentials.json
#
# =============================================================================
# Hermes Runtime: All API keys, tokens, passwords, and credentials are excluded
# per security policy. They are injected at runtime from $HERMES_HOME/.env.
# Never commit actual key/secret values to this repository.
# =============================================================================
